  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "🆕 **Additions**\n- Added `ProcessInvocationPipeline` internal class.\n- Added a `ProcessInvoker` constructor accepting a middleware chain, with chain routing.\n- Added pipeline dispatch and invoker integration tests.\n\n⚙️ **Modifications**\n- Wired invokers to `ProcessInvocationPipeline`.\n- Updated `ProcessInvocationPipeline` and `ExternalProcess` implementations.\n- Specified `Lock` type for shared synchronization.\n- Replaced `var` usage with explicit types; cleaned up `using` statements.\n- Addressed PR #397 review findings in `ProcessInvocationPipeline` wiring.\n- Renamed `ProcessInvocationContext` to `InvocationContext` across invokers.\n\n🐛 **Bug Fixes**\n- Fixed a `WaitForExitAsync` pipe EOF hang on Linux.\n- Fixed output redirection for timeout in the SuspendResume test.",
